stateDiagram-v2
    %% USB write (commands/disk.rs, platform::flash, safety/flash_auth.rs).
    %% Phases match FlashProgress.phase emitted as `flash:progress`.
    [*] --> listing

    listing --> selected : user picks a disk
    listing --> listing : system disk (blocked_reason set, not selectable)

    selected --> confirming : flash_prepare_confirmation
    confirming --> selected : token expired (5 min) / user cancels

    confirming --> prepare : flash_usb(token)

    prepare --> failed : token invalid, used or expired
    prepare --> failed : disk identity changed / now a system disk
    prepare --> failed : no elevation
    prepare --> partition : checks passed

    partition --> format
    format --> copy_efi
    copy_efi --> copy_recovery : recovery image selected
    copy_efi --> verify : no recovery image
    copy_recovery --> verify
    verify --> complete : files match the source
    verify --> failed : mismatch

    partition --> failed : tool error / cancel
    format --> failed : tool error / cancel
    copy_efi --> failed : I/O error / cancel
    copy_recovery --> failed : I/O error / cancel

    complete --> [*]
    failed --> listing : retry (needs a new token)

    note right of confirming
        Token = HMAC-SHA256 over disk identity,
        EFI hash and recovery choice, bound to
        the app session, single use.
    end note
